  "text": "In October 2021, nine of us reached for \"the debt ceiling,\" peaking on 2021-10-12, though the phrase was first said back in 2011 by Tom McClintock. Seven of us said \"raise the debt ceiling\" that same day. Alongside it ran the tax collector: seven of us said \"internal revenue service,\" six added \"the internal revenue service irs,\" both cresting on 2021-10-21, the same day six of us invoked \"millions of americans.\" Six of us named \"attorney general merrick\" on 2021-10-07. Six said \"secretary of state.\" Six said \"ranking member of.\" We record that our most-repeated line concerned a limit and whether to raise it, and that we returned, six and seven at a time, to the agency that collects and the officials who administer. This is the shape of what we said, and how many of us said each thing.",
